WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.473
Hi, I'm Pear!

00:00:02.473 --> 00:00:06.416
Qwen-Image-2.1 wants every request rewritten by a big model first.

00:00:06.416 --> 00:00:09.570
Here's how two small students learned that job.

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:14.676
The pocket models do the teacher's job with no system prompt and no thinking.

00:00:14.676 --> 00:00:16.072
It's all in the weights.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.284
You type a short request, and the rewriter reads it first.

00:00:22.704 --> 00:00:26.650
It returns one line of JSON: a long description of the finished

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.295
picture, and an aspect ratio.

00:00:28.715 --> 00:00:33.464
That description joins the sequence all thirty-two blocks process: thirty-four tokens as

00:00:33.464 --> 00:00:37.026
typed, four hundred and forty-six from the small rewriter.

00:00:37.446 --> 00:00:41.185
Without a prefix cache, every denoising step pays for it, at about

00:00:41.185 --> 00:00:43.055
one point four times the cost.

00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:48.215
The teacher reads a long system prompt, then thinks for about eight

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:49.514
hundred tokens before answering.

00:00:49.934 --> 00:00:54.035
The students get no system prompt, and their template closes the think block.

00:00:54.035 --> 00:00:55.297
They answer straight away.

00:00:56.567 --> 00:01:01.230
A small model wrote eight thousand seven hundred and ninety-seven synthetic requests.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.623
The nine-B teacher rewrote every one.

00:01:04.581 --> 00:01:08.460
A hard filter kept valid rewrites of eighty to four hundred words.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.471
Both students trained on the survivors for two epochs.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.593
That word limit chose the curriculum.

00:01:14.593 --> 00:01:18.338
About seventy percent of stickers and logos got in, and almost

00:01:18.338 --> 00:01:19.700
no posters or screens.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:25.365
On four test renders, the requests as typed passed seven of nine checks.

00:01:25.365 --> 00:01:28.876
The small rewriter's passed one: each described a different picture.

00:01:30.017 --> 00:01:34.160
The students copied the teacher's format, not yet its effect on pictures.

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.577
And every rewrite lengthens the denoiser's work.

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.047
To recap: a rewriter describes the picture, the students learned it without

00:01:42.047 --> 00:01:44.970
a prompt, and a word limit chose their lessons.

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.352
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:47.352 --> 00:01:47.912
I'm Pear.

00:01:47.912 --> 00:01:48.193
Bye!
